    "title": "Bloedel Donovan Park reopens with upgraded playground - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jason Upton ,\n5 hours ago BELLINGHAM, WA (MyBellinghamNow.com) – One of Bellingham’s most popular parks is back and better than ever. Bellingham Parks and Recreation says the new playground at Bloedel Donovan Park is now open following nearly two months of construction. My Bellingham Now previously reported that the park was closed since... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
